BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brokeback Mountain
DTSTART:20250622T200000Z
DTEND:20250622T223500Z
DTSTAMP:20250622T200000Z
UID:55XeC1gAdU
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 134 mins (2h14m)\n\n“I wish I knew how to quit you
 .” Celebrate 20 years of Brokeback Mountain with SIFF. Ang Lee’s haunt
 ing\, tender story of forbidden love between two cowboys brought to life b
 y unforgettable performances from Heath Ledger and Jake Gyllenhaal\, was n
 othing short of revolutionary. A turning point for queer cinema and a land
 mark in American film\, Brokeback Mountain continues to move and challenge
  audiences two decades later. See it on the big screen while you can.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/brokeback-mountain
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
