SUMMARY:The Life of Chuck
DTSTART:20250626T230000Z
DTEND:20250627T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20250626T230000Z
UID:4OGKrAl6cJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nFrom the hearts and minds of Ste
 phen King and Mike Flanagan comes The Life of Chuck\, the extraordinary st
 ory of an ordinary man. This unforgettable\, genre-bending tale celebrates
  the life of Charles 'Chuck' Krantz as he experiences the wonder of love\,
  the heartbreak of loss\, and the multitudes contained in all of us. Toro
 nto International Film Festival 2024 People's Choice Award winner.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/life-of-chuck
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
