BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:We Ride Why
DTSTART:20250629T023000Z
DTEND:20250629T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20250629T023000Z
UID:Du4sUpKw4u
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 70 mins (1h10m)\n\nPresented by Noir Rouge Producti
 ons. We Ride Why is a documentary film about the power of love\, community
 \, and hope in the face of cancer. The film follows the stories of several
  women who have been impacted by cancer\, as well as the friends and famil
 y who support them. Through their stories\, we learn about the collateral 
 damage that cancer can bring\, but also the hope that can be found in the 
 relationships that are born out of trauma. We also see how a strong commu
 nity in Seattle\, Washington has formed to support all those impacted by c
 ancer.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/we-ride-why
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
