BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Year of the Fox
DTSTART:20250712T020000Z
DTEND:20250712T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20250712T020000Z
UID:8ugIqJhH0D
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nYear of the Fox follows Ivy\, a b
 iracial teenager navigating Aspen's elite party scene amidst her adoptive 
 parents' bitter divorce. As she watches her wealthy community provide cove
 r for predatory behavior\, Ivy struggles to find her own path without losi
 ng herself in this compelling exploration of the complexities of power\, p
 rivilege\, and personal agency. Director Megan Griffiths scheduled to atte
 nd for a post-film Q&A on July 11.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theat
 ers/year-of-the-fox
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
